<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Semu</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Semu was a category in the social hierarchy of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yuan-dynasty">Yuan Dynasty</a>, covering peoples of Central and Western Asian origin. Ranked below the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mongols">Mongols</a> but above northern and southern Chinese, the Semu held many administrative and financial posts. Accounts of the Yuan Dynasty describe how this four-tier system shaped access to offices, legal protection and military roles.</p></div>
